  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $\\sim(p \\vee \\sim q) \\vee \\sim(p \\vee q)$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\equiv(\\sim p \\vee q) \\vee(\\sim p \\vee \\sim q) \\\\\n&\\equiv \\sim p \\vee(q \\vee \\sim q) \\\\\n&\\equiv \\sim p\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
